      "selector": ".sqs-html-content (index 0)",
      "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Summer Swells</strong></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">When summer is in full swing, nothing cools you off like a beach day by the ocean. Our oceans bring us joy in many forms. Whether it's a romantic date spot that eventually leads to that destination wedding, a peaceful getaway from the daily desk job or surfing the sets that no one believes happened these summer swells are magical moments that give nostalgia to all.</p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\">24” X 30” Mixed media acrylic painting with organic plaster base layer on gallery wrapped canvas. Ready to hand.</span></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\">Sold.</span></p></div>",
